Move to Server Directory
Move the GyanBook folder to your local server's root directory:

XAMPP: C:\xampp\htdocs\GyanBook

WAMP: C:\wamp\www\GyanBook

Database Setup

Open http://localhost/phpmyadmin in your browser.

Create a new database named gk_software.

Look for the database.sql file in this repository and import it into your gk_software database, OR run the SQL queries manually to create the users, questions, results, and stories tables.

Run the Application

Open your browser and go to http://localhost/GyanBook

Default Admin Password: admin123 (Can be changed in admin.php)

📂 Project Structure
index.php - Home page featuring the hero section and dynamic motivational stories.

register.php / login.php - Secure user authentication pages.

quiz.php - Category selection and interactive exam interface.

submit_quiz.php - Backend logic to evaluate answers and save results.

certificate.php - Generates a beautifully styled, printable completion certificate.

admin.php - The central hub for administrators to manage content and view logs.

edit_question.php - Dedicated interface for updating existing quiz questions.

navbar.php - Reusable stylish navigation bar with session handling.

db.php - Database connection configuration.

